                <pb facs="0330" n="238" xml:id="pg238"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hart to Mr. Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogota</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1898-11-15">(<hi rendition="#italic"
                                >14th</hi>), <hi rendition="#italic">November 15,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>On motion of Government, Senate passed on first reading bill authorizing payment
                    Panama claim; strong opposition, but minister for foreign affairs says bill will
                    pass both houses within five or six days.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hart.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
